# bass2 (docs/wsp/research/phys_bass2.md, sha256 f2bdb28c05bbe83f23fe12820d0c068e02e0e17cf407eccdb885318c51574b17): the W0 block of phys_bass1_w0.md 7.4 (one changed line in place), the D1 block of phys_bass1_d1.md, then the new lines
# A revision of the slug's neutral root; numbers verbatim.
# bass1.wsp: W0, zero-shot. Author claude-fable-5-2. Source: docs/wsp/research/phys_bass1_w0.md
